Package: AntPhyloMaker
Title: Tools for Extracting, Grafting, and Assembling Ant Phylogenies
Version: 2026.03.05.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Marek", "Borowiec", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "marek.borowiec@colostate.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7510-4064"))
Description: Provides tools to extract cleaned genus-level subtrees 
    with outgroups, graft donor genus trees into an ultrametric backbone 
    chronogram (including stem-aware chronos-based rescaling), fill genus-
    level tips with species-level names using AntWiki, convert AntWiki 
    tables to TACT taxonomy format, and generate autosized or paginated 
    PDF plots of large phylogenies.
